SUMMARY:Part Closure: BARONS COURT STATION: From Monday 6 July until 
 November\, westbound trains will not call at Barons Court. If travelling 
 westbound from the station\, please use eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains and change to westbound services at West Kensington (on the 
 District line) or Earls Court (on the Piccadilly line) and change to 
 westbound services. If travelling westbound to the station\, please 
 continue to Hammersmith and change for eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261024T090555Z
UID:1eebbdeb-cf8a-11f1-a9dd-6045bd04bda0
DTSTART:20261024
DTEND:20261026
SUMMARY:Part Closure: DISTRICT LINE: Saturday 24 and Sunday 25 October\, no
  service between Edgware Road / Embankment and Ealing Broadway / 
 Kensington (Olympia) / Richmond / Wimbledon. Use MILDMAY LINE services 
 between Gunnersbury\, Kew Gardens and Richmond. Replacement bus services 
 operate. If travelling to Chelsea vs Tottenham Hotspur on Saturday 
 evening\, please use the PICCADILLY LINE to/from Earls Court and continue 
 at street level.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR